{"id":"740820205","kind":"answer","title":"怎么获取anki中的分享牌组，怎么下载到anki呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2019-07-07","updated":"2021-11-17","votes":198,"comment_count":69,"minutes":2,"chars":736,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","记忆卡片","知识表征","助记媒介"],"summary":"我更推荐自己做卡片： 叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解 首先，只要能够得到 anki 的牌组文件，就能获取别人的分享牌组。 官方的分享牌组地址： https:// ankiweb.net/shared/deck s/ 至于得到后如何使用，可以参见下面这个教程（从我的电子书复制的） .apkg 文件（「牌组/记忆库」…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/331439631/answer/740820205","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"3.1.1 Windows/Mac"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"3.1.2 Android"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"3.1.3 iOS"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"UFHGXZGC\">我更推荐自己做卡片：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"gKV0jfF0\">首先，只要能够得到 anki 的牌组文件，就能获取别人的分享牌组。</p><p data-pid=\"KC9IvkkW\">官方的分享牌组地址：<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://ankiweb.net/shared/decks/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">ankiweb.net/shared/deck</span><span class=\"invisible\">s/</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p data-pid=\"NAgL3yey\">至于得到后如何使用，可以参见下面这个教程（从我的电子书复制的）</p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"N5YORcpn\">.apkg 文件（「牌组/记忆库」）在各系统的打开方法</blockquote><ul><li data-pid=\"lAZQaUFU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/ankigaokao/784666#311_WindowsMac_10\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3.1.1 Windows/Mac</a></li><li data-pid=\"D41q_CdN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/ankigaokao/784666#312_Android_20\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3.1.2 Android</a></li><li data-pid=\"cZpfwtpq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/ankigaokao/784666#313_iOS_50\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3.1.3 iOS</a></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"vVymlKaE\">「牌组/记忆库」即「卡片」的集合，用于分类储存「卡片」。<br/>试用材料请用百度云下载</p><blockquote data-pid=\"9Kiy0NND\">点击下面的链接即可<br/><b>注意</b>，这会导致转跳到本书之外的网站<br/><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1dA5jpF4PoyIlnAG2Z3m0PQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">pan.baidu.com/s/1dA5jpF</span><span class=\"invisible\">4PoyIlnAG2Z3m0PQ</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-1\">3.1.1 Windows/Mac</h2><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb510f7617baa910b8c98b02521a49a5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3bcca2b6175225cb29c4e9ec93cb73d7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-39ce1c31078803fe20bca99b453e2e2f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb510f7617baa910b8c98b02521a49a5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3bcca2b6175225cb29c4e9ec93cb73d7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-39ce1c31078803fe20bca99b453e2e2f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"qpqPCOhy\">如图所示，只要你安装好 Anki，.apkg 文件就会自动关联好，只要双击打开，就可以导入了。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9650a074fa270b7d45813c02264473fb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-109ab1b14eac496b40b7b9167d8aee66\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-898122ecf55e9a9ff899382e6a023a92_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"395\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9650a074fa270b7d45813c02264473fb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-109ab1b14eac496b40b7b9167d8aee66\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-898122ecf55e9a9ff899382e6a023a92_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"395\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"Mn6YY17Q\">如果不行的话，就像上图所示，手动导入。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">3.1.2 Android</h2><p data-pid=\"Ua_TssaY\">首先，由于 AnkiDroid 不能关联 .apkg 文件，所以你是<b>无法直接打开</b>下载下来的牌组的！</p><p data-pid=\"A5Xvm0P_\">那该怎么导入卡片呢？</p><p data-pid=\"t-tEdOm2\">我们得曲线救国，即手动导入卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"eoLKCRW1\">在这之前，我们需要把下载下来的文件移动到指定路径。</p><p data-pid=\"8BF8tRbx\">怎么移动文件？你得先找到下载的 .apkg 文件</p><p data-pid=\"u04wnaO1\">先点击系统自带的文件管理</p><p data-pid=\"BciHb80a\">搜索 .apkg</p><p data-pid=\"XqZgo-mB\">如果你下载前面的牌组，你就可以找到下图的文件了</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-070df0e61f104cc2782e1fdfeb53db42_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0ad372e74d02a55e7a1cf1f3b836381b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ce625484f7d3a38c5d4b979e29bac3cf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-070df0e61f104cc2782e1fdfeb53db42_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0ad372e74d02a55e7a1cf1f3b836381b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ce625484f7d3a38c5d4b979e29bac3cf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"rGAjKXk9\">你只需要把 .apkg 文件复制或移动到下图的路径即可</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e0fdca303c04c22bf01a3e0c43f13d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-32b4b2c10bc386152ee106a6374a2160\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2ce7c0b25d0b9b136f92eeafeb8bda41_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"884\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e0fdca303c04c22bf01a3e0c43f13d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-32b4b2c10bc386152ee106a6374a2160\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ce7c0b25d0b9b136f92eeafeb8bda41_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"884\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"uomusuCF\">然后就可以打开 AnkiDroid 进行导入操作</p><p data-pid=\"4DniTfku\">具体过程如下图</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-original-token=\"v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87\" data-thumbnail=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87_720w.gif?source=2c26e567\" width=\"240\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87\" data-thumbnail=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12fd09a13e8bedbe12ed08e092f9ae87_720w.gif?source=2c26e567\" width=\"240\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">3.1.3 iOS</h2><p data-pid=\"bjjPvi1Z\">打开百度云</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-383598858b9b5175f74847f1168acf25_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-adc045ff70489830109a75e6ac4e4352\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a3126aa97022f8f22f71748bcbab9360_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-383598858b9b5175f74847f1168acf25_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-adc045ff70489830109a75e6ac4e4352\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a3126aa97022f8f22f71748bcbab9360_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"U_hNPnOk\">下载</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-518a76d99fe81ce452ff2d8bad7b89d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c8f3c12be5b734ee28965c022c80cfd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ac45344474b4ba9f1f65b973e5974cca_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-518a76d99fe81ce452ff2d8bad7b89d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c8f3c12be5b734ee28965c022c80cfd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ac45344474b4ba9f1f65b973e5974cca_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"BtfgFarM\">打开</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f420fc6c2d61c9ee15158240d252bd3d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9d05f53708c1ce232b439be1135cf1cd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-713f2f7d556e4a8ebaeddcb006784055_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f420fc6c2d61c9ee15158240d252bd3d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9d05f53708c1ce232b439be1135cf1cd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-713f2f7d556e4a8ebaeddcb006784055_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ZM3xlhLL\">如果有 Copy to Anki 就直接点</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-90dc47b9596aa7c5f3294474ad3e94f8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e81cf651cd03384cc232c83711eceb86\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-329483016125c21cf949cc4d9e61b845_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-90dc47b9596aa7c5f3294474ad3e94f8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e81cf651cd03384cc232c83711eceb86\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-329483016125c21cf949cc4d9e61b845_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"616\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"k-qzmM8e\">如果没有，可能藏在 More 里面</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Derek Sivers"},{"id":"718778050","title":"间隔重复的有效实践","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":286,"minutes":40,"reason":"延伸深读 · Fernando Borretti"},{"id":"593630309","title":"用间隔重复系统来看穿数学概念","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":493,"minutes":25,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"},{"id":"397271029","title":"学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"3953703611","title":"运用记忆系统背诵文章段落","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":183,"minutes":28,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1237302748","title":"如何提高anki 制卡的效率?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":371,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 371 赞同"},{"id":"1373610154","title":"anki为什么没有在学生群体中大火起来？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":370,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 370 赞同"},{"id":"1993535529","title":"如何看待自己的考研整理的 anki 卡组被白嫖?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":141,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 141 赞同"},{"id":"2819053570","title":"高中生物应该背书还是刷题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":186,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 186 赞同"},{"id":"3130195046","title":"被北大录取女生分享经验时强调「没手机」，你上大学前有手机吗，是否会影响你的学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":278,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 278 赞同"}]}